    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai Casual Slider</strong> is a relaxing tile puzzle game where you rearrange pieces to reveal beautifully drawn illustrations in anime style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a calm and satisfying experience with 100 exclusive artworks, smooth sound effects, and a soft, atmospheric soundtrack. The built-in gallery lets you revisit each unlocked image at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 Unlock 100 original illustrations as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Full gallery mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Relaxing soundtrack and pleasant sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Voice effects included to enrich the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Steam achievements included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 All illustrations are presented in their original, unaltered form \u2014 no filters or visual obstructions.<br><br>This game contains partial nudity and artistic illustrations not suitable for all audiences.</p></li></ul>",
